        "original_id": "aea84701-8ec5-5393-94ac-df0a2c482efe",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mohsin Fani\n- Works: Dabestan-e Mazaheb, Dabistan-E-Mazahib\n- Topics: Persian historiography, South Asian religions, religious sects\n\nFacts:\n- Mohsin Fani was a noted Persian historian from Iran.\n- Some sources suggest that Mohsin Fani was the author of Dabistan-E-Mazahib.\n- The Dabestān-e Mazāheb, also transliterated as Dabistān-i Mazāhib and translated as \"School of Religions,\" examines and compares South Asian religions and sects of the mid-17th century.",
